Z||000000||theogre||12-17-2000||03:13 PM||||There are allot of questions in the forum about this. I had found this awhile back but lost the link.... here it is again.<P><A HREF="http://www.sa-motorsports.com/" TARGET=_blank>Standard Abrasives Motor Sports Division</A><P>They have both the materials for this project and a really good DIY guide for it. Anyone considering doing this or having it done should at least read their guide. it answers just about every question you could have. The guide is available online and as an Acrobat file. <P>Another source for supplies online is <A HREF="http://www.eastwoodco.com" TARGET=_blank>Eastwood</A> Some of the online stores like carparts.com and wrenchead may also have stuff.<P>------------------<BR>Lake Superior? Is that what I stepped in? Sorry.||||reg||1
